Modifications
-------------

The AFM files were converted to the JSON format of tc-lib-pdf-font
(https://github.com/tecnickcom/tc-lib-pdf-font) with its `util/convert.php`
(`--type=Core`, `--encoding=cp1252`; Symbol: `--encoding=symbol`;
ZapfDingbats: no encoding). The AFM sources were taken from
https://github.com/tecnickcom/tc-font-mirror. Each resulting file states this
in its `_modification` member. No other changes were made; the metric values
are those of the AFM files.


Trademarks
----------

Helvetica and Times are trademarks of Linotype-Hell AG and/or its subsidiaries
(today Monotype); ITC Zapf Dingbats is a registered trademark of International
Typeface Corporation. The names appear here because the PDF specification uses
exactly these names for the 14 standard fonts, so a PDF document has to name
them to request them from the viewer.
